          "text": "issue (blocking): When the source resolves its trunk through local `main` or `master`, `trunk_remote_ref` becomes null and the following loop deletes every `origin/*` ref. The resulting squashed rehearsal lacks `origin/main`, unlike the post-squash CI checkout it promises to model, so a probe that skips when that ref is absent can falsely pass.",
